    <briefdescription>
<para>Transport-independent link that owns a parser and dispatches packets. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The link owns a parser, dispatches every valid packet to a handler, and encodes outgoing packets into a caller-supplied write function. It has no RTOS or driver dependency: the integrator moves received bytes from the UART/USB/socket into <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga6a2658870c637c2335fdbed8594296e8" kindref="member">dxl2_link_receive</ref> and provides the byte writer.</para>
<para>A link is not thread-safe. Call <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga6a2658870c637c2335fdbed8594296e8" kindref="member">dxl2_link_receive</ref> from one context only (for example an RX thread, not an interrupt handler), and serialize <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1gaaf14e858ba2e54e6a63fda49b87660bb" kindref="member">dxl2_link_send</ref> calls from several contexts with a mutex.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Public interface includes:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Lifecycle: <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga8db6e8221a44003aa7d1f2f829230ae8" kindref="member">dxl2_link_init</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Message flow: <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga6a2658870c637c2335fdbed8594296e8" kindref="member">dxl2_link_receive</ref>, <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1gaaf14e858ba2e54e6a63fda49b87660bb" kindref="member">dxl2_link_send</ref>, <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga378fb8ad8cf0a3ee498e91f391938fd0" kindref="member">dxl2_link_send_status</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Diagnostics: <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga06325aaf0b7edc509f871670fbc43b1c" kindref="member">dxl2_link_rx_packets</ref>, <ref refid="group__dxl2__link_1ga36d609f1afd6827e3acca76ecce4e478" kindref="member">dxl2_link_invalid_packets</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
